Package: reclaim
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jordan Augé <your@email.com>
Description: Modern disk space analyzer
 Reclaim is a modern, intelligent disk space analyzer with:
 - Fast scanning with SQLite caching
 - Smart grouping of duplicate files
 - Full disk space categorization
 - Native GUI with treemap visualization
 - Permission-aware scanning (Full Disk Access on macOS)
 .
 This is the system package version (auto-update disabled).
 Update via: sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade reclaim
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgcc-s1 (>= 3.0), libstdc++6 (>= 10)
Homepage: https://github.com/jordanauge/reclaim
